# Spice Route Kitchen: Restaurant Landing Page

A fast, responsive website for a fictional South Indian restaurant, built as a portfolio project.

**Live demo:** _add your Vercel link here_

## The problem it solves
Small restaurants lose orders when customers can't easily see the menu or book a table on mobile. This site lets a customer order a dish or reserve a table in two taps, through WhatsApp, with no backend or monthly fees.

## Features
- Mobile-first responsive layout
- One-tap WhatsApp ordering and table booking (pre-filled messages)
- Scroll animations and animated counters
- Embedded Google Map, lazy-loaded images
- No frameworks or dependencies, loads in about a second

## Customise
- Change `WHATSAPP_NUMBER` in `script.js`
- Add photos to `images/` (`hero.jpg`, `chicken.jpg`, `fish.jpg`, `dosa.jpg`, `biryani.jpg`)

## Tech
HTML5, CSS3 (Grid, Flexbox, variables), vanilla JavaScript (IntersectionObserver), Google Fonts